    "description": "Synthetic pages for a local preview: a live lander with a new version waiting, a live variant, a live listicle, a code page, 30 days of visits from ads, organic and outreach, and one ad that links to the lander"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "@wren/sites/src/chat-widget.ts",
   "role": "file",
