   "role": "file",
   "parent": "@wren/sites",
   "group": "@wren/sites",
   "attrs": {
    "description": "One page's detail, past its row in the list: its copy and versions (a data page), where it is (a code page), its numbers by day and by source, the ads that link to it with spend and arrivals per ad, and its variants side by side"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "@wren/sites/src/draft.ts",
   "role": "file",
   "parent": "@wren/sites",
   "group": "@wren/sites",
   "attrs": {
    "description": "Claude's first draft of a page's copy from an offer, checked by the facts guard (`@wren/core/grounded`): a first-person claim no fact backs, or a number in neither the offer nor the facts, gets one more try; flagged again, it's dropped and the offer's own fill stays"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "@wren/sites/src/form-split.ts",
   "role": "file",
   "parent": "@wren/sites",
   "group": "@wren/sites",
   "attrs": {
    "description": "A/B per hosted form: the form's address serves the form as it is (A) or `b`, by B's weight, and the `wab` cookie keeps a visitor on their arm"
   }
  },
